# Fisher41

A 41-dimensional counterexample to convexity of Fisher information along the Gaussian heat flow.

* Trusted statement: `Fisher41/Defs.lean`, `Fisher41/Density.lean`, `Fisher41/Statement.lean`.
* Final theorems: `Fisher41.paperTheorem1` (Theorem 1 of the manuscript), `Fisher41.pdfMain`,
  `Fisher41.fisherSecondDerivNeg`, `Fisher41.fisherNonconvex`, and the Formal Conjectures target
  `Arxiv.«2605.18081».fisherInformationConvexity` (`Fisher41/FC/`).
-/
